# EAS Build reads this file INSTEAD of .gitignore when deciding which
# files to upload. This repo is a monorepo, so by default EAS uploaded
# the whole thing (~158 MB). We only build the Expo apps (customer-app,
# staff-app), so exclude the heavy, unrelated parts of the repo.
#
# NOTE: because this replaces .gitignore, we must also re-exclude
# node_modules and caches here, or they would get uploaded.

# --- Reinstalled / regenerated on the build server ---
**/node_modules/
**/.expo/
**/dist/
**/web-build/
.git/

# --- Monorepo parts not needed to build the mobile apps ---
/tmp/
/public/
/src/
/supabase/
/whatsapp-bot/
/old whatsapp bots/
/store-assets/
/poster-output/
/docs/
/scripts/
/tools/
/.github/
